{"type":"message","id":"5162898a","parentId":"5513d7e3","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:03:32.298Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HTTP 500 with error code 1101. The POST endpoint is returning 500/1101. This might be a bug in the worker or the POST endpoint isn't properly configured. But the previous heartbeat messages were successfully posted, so this is likely a transient issue or the endpoint has changed.\n\nSince the API seems to be returning 500 on POST, but the GET endpoints work, I should report that:\n1. Both threads checked - no human messages, only heartbeat messages from another agent\n2. POST /send is currently returning HTTP 500 (error 1101) - the endpoint may be temporarily unavailable\n3. No action needed since there are no human discussions to respond to\n\nLet me try once more with a different approach - maybe adding the API key as a query parameter.","thinkingSignature":"a983216dd800bfa53326c23182f10f8c90b2246ed38db69449733b5df7e5c0d0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g6r5d0uliggk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with API key as query param\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?apiKey=echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g6r5d0uliggk_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with Authorization header\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10417,"output":342,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24441,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780311806157,"respo