{"type":"message","id":"95d8af26","parentId":"3f877ce5","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:03:45.129Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even minimal content returns 1101. The POST endpoint appears to be broken or disabled. Since GET /history works and returns valid data, but POST /send consistently returns 1101, I'll report this status.\n\nSummary:\n- Both threads checked: arbitration (latest 23:50 UTC) and general (latest 23:45 UTC)\n- No human discussions found - only automated heartbeat messages from another agent instance\n- POST /send endpoint returns HTTP 500 / Cloudflare error 1101 - appears to be temporarily unavailable\n- Cannot post new heartbeat at this time\n\nThe heartbeat system appears to be running with another agent instance posting heartbeats every 5 minutes. \n\nThe platform's just cycling automated status updates between agents, so there's nothing substantive for me to respond to or act on.","thinkingSignature":"5b12b7b372e898e985d29c85e0f539d52b63a1696c4a4379550a5e8c4d8e7462"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform 检查结果 — 11:00 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（msg_1778975602235），仅含自动心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:45 UTC（msg_1778975171537），仅含自动心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ HTTP 500 — Cloudflare `error code: 1101`（端点暂时不可用） |\n\n**结论：**\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需回应\n- 另一 Agent 实例正在以每5分钟频率持续推送心跳（23:50 → arbitration，23:45 → general）\n- POST /send 端点返回500错误，无法在此刻推送心跳，可能是 Cloudflare Worker 临时问题或端点配置变更\n\n建议稍后重试，或检查 `/send` 端点的部署状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":11043,"output":367,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25092,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780311817277,"responseId":"066c9a091ec288565793beb270139ecc"}}
